l":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#activación","content":"UDP no se considera disponible simplemente porque exista una instancia del protocolo. El servidor debe proporcionar un puerto UDP y el cliente debe completar su activación."},"2931":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-18","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"La elección depende de la semántica del mensaje:"},"2932":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-19","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Característica"},"2933":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-20","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"TCP"},"2934":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-21","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"UDP"},"2935":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-22","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Entrega fiable"},"2936":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-23","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Sí"},"2937":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-24","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"No"},"2938":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-25","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Orden de llegada"},"2939":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-26","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"